OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers on Sunday.
OL,7,FMild and windy with rain on Monday.
OL,8,FMainly dry and bright on Tuesday.
